pos/godotengine/godot/issues/117310","id":4036905486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wnkoO","user":{"login":"jordedwards","id":29870473,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODcwNDcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29870473?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards","html_url":"https://github.com/jordedwards","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-11T06:47:57Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T06:47:57Z","body":"Skimming the source code, I believe line 214 in `scene/2d/physics/shape_cast_2d.cpp` may be the culprit.\n\n`const int steps = MAX(2, target_position.length() / shape->get_rect().get_size().length() * 4);`\n\nIf a shape is added where `get_rect().get_size().length() ` is 0, this would cause a division by 0 and I believe may be undefined behaviour? However, I see this line was added 4 years ago when the ShapeCast2D node was introduced, could it really have been around for so long without a fix?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4036905486/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4039090429","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117310#issuecomment-4039090429","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117310","id":4039090429,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wv6D9","user":{"login":"TrueJole","id":121569485,"node_id":"U_kgDOBz8AzQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121569485?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole","html_url":"https://github.com/TrueJole","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-11T13:06:57Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T13:07:37Z","body":"I can not reproduce it on my system: \nGodot v4.6.1.stable (14d19694e) - Freedesktop SDK 25.08 (Flatpak runtime) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon 840M Graphics (RADV GFX1152) - AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 w/ Radeon 840M (12 threads) - 13.29 GiB memory","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4039090429/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4039683656","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117310#issuecomment-4039683656","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117310","id":4039683656,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wyK5I","user":{"login":"jordedwards","id":29870473,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODcwNDcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29870473?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards","html_url":"https://github.com/jordedwards","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-11T14:37:45Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T14:37:45Z","body":"Thanks for checking, perhaps this is specific to osx then. I'll try compiling the engine later to confirm if it is indeed an issue with the division by 0.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4039683656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4040002881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117310#issuecomment-4040002881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117310","id":4040002881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wzY1B","user":{"login":"jordedwards","id":29870473,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODcwNDcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29870473?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards","html_url":"https://github.com/jordedwards","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jordedwards/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-11T15:23:40Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T15:24:14Z","body":"```\nconst real_t shape_size = shape->get_rect().get_size().length();\nprint_line(\"shape_size:\", shape_size, \"division result:\", target_position.length() / shape_size);\n```\n\nAlright after adding this print I can see the issue, it's returning `inf` and then attempts to draw \"infinite steps\" which is leading to an OOM error. I added a guard to force it to 2 steps in this case and now these shapes are working as expected. Will create a PR to address this.\n\n<img width=\"341\" height=\"67\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c97801c1-0698-4962-82cf-3652874c6353\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4040002881/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4052013787","html_url":"https://githu